    <sectiondef kind="define">
      <memberdef kind="define" id="dirac_8h_1a5a5d8c67c6041d3f765f183deb9919ff" prot="public" static="no">
        <name>MAX_DWT_LEVELS</name>
        <initializer>5</initializer>
        <briefdescription>
<para>The spec limits the number of wavelet decompositions to 4 for both level 1 (VC-2) and 128 (long-gop default). </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>5 decompositions is the maximum before &gt;16-bit buffers are needed. Schroedinger allows this for DD 9,7 and 13,7 wavelets only, limiting the others to 4 decompositions (or 3 for the fidelity filter).</para>
<para>We use this instead of MAX_DECOMPOSITIONS to save some memory. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
